  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.6.6: faster HEVC decoding with optimized CABAC, SAO, rotation and parallel WPP for single pictures; decoded pixels unchanged. Faster intra encoding with fewer mode trials and RDOQ for the selected mode: about 29% less single-thread time and 17% fewer allocations on a 12 MP photo. Encoded bytes change; Kodak equal-quality size cost averages +0.95% RGB PSNR / +1.26% luma SSIM. Requires PictureSharp 0.7.6. Notes: https://github.com/art-ix/PictureSharp.Heif/blob/v0.6.6/docs/releases/release-0.6.6.md",
